ENGLISH SUMMARY (the Portuguese text above prevails)

Source-available, NOT open source. You may view the code, fork it and customize the look and feel for your own
use, only if every user holds an active apliKI subscription and the app keeps talking exclusively to the
official apliKI backend. You may NOT: redistribute, sell or publish it in app stores; build a competing product;
remove or bypass subscription checks or limits; reverse engineer the backend, APIs, rules or prompts; use AI
systems (LLMs, coding agents, copilots) to copy, rewrite, translate, port or derive the app's logic for use
outside apliKI or to avoid the subscription; or use this code to train, fine-tune, evaluate or ground AI models.
Violations terminate the license automatically.
